{"id":"n66415-1-8","stage":3,"title":"안색 · 脸色","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66415-1-8-1","ko":"너 왜 이렇게 안색이 안 좋아?","zh":"你为什么脸色这么差啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안색이","meaning":"脸色，神色","explanation":"안색：脸色，神色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"안색","audio":"/audio/4228096eb5f0b5bf77d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66415","senseId":"1","lemma":"안색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아?","meaning":"好，良好","explanation":"좋다：好，良好；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"4","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"4228096eb5f0b5bf","term":"안색","zh":"脸色，神色","audio":"/audio/4228096eb5f0b5bf77d5.mp3","entryId":"66415","definition":"脸上露出的表情或光泽。","pronunciation":["안색"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，良好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"身体条件或健康状态等高于一般人。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/93df7d0851d656384203.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66415-1-8-2","ko":"몸살이 오려는지 컨디션이 별로 안 좋네.","zh":"好像要感冒了，状态不太好呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몸살이","meaning":"浑身难受，过劳而病","explanation":"몸살：浑身难受，过劳而病；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸살","audio":"/audio/78bf29d1a4f75a6d621f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54741","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오려는지","meaning":"感到，袭来；表示某种情况将要发生（-려고 하다）","explanation":"오다：感到，袭来；하다：表示某种情况将要发生（-려고 하다）；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"18","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"컨디션이","meaning":"状态，气色","explanation":"컨디션：状态，气色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"컨디션","audio":"/audio/f64da2fd6ef848dfb234.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28154","senseId":"1","lemma":"컨디션","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"별로","meaning":"特别，格外","explanation":"별로：特别，格外","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋네.","meaning":"好，良好","explanation":"좋다：好，良好；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"4","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"78bf29d1a4f75a6d","term":"몸살","zh":"浑身难受，过劳而病","audio":"/audio/78bf29d1a4f75a6d621f.mp3","entryId":"54741","definition":"身体过度疲劳时，全身酸痛无力、发烧的病症。","pronunciation":["몸살"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"感到，袭来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"感到，袭来","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示某种情况将要发生（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示某种情况将要发生（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f64da2fd6ef848df","term":"컨디션","zh":"状态，气色","audio":"/audio/f64da2fd6ef848dfb234.mp3","entryId":"28154","definition":"身体或健康，心里等的状况。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"特别，格外","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"特殊额外地；或指那么不同地。","pronunciation":["별로"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，良好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"身体条件或健康状态等高于一般人。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/07b47e24181141d518cb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.129,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66415","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":109,"sequenceScore":2.8543,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好像要感冒了，状态不太好呢。","你怎么知道我昨天和弟弟或妹妹一起去看电影了？"